msgid "mlx.core.new\\_thread\\_unsafe\\_stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.new_thread_unsafe_stream:1
msgid "Make a new stream that can be used in any thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../docstring of mlx.core.new_thread_unsafe_stream:3
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`new_stream` which can only work on the thread of creation, "
"streams created by this API can be passed to and evaluated anywhere, but "
"note that currently all nodes in a graph must be evaluated in sequence and "
"it is user's responsibilty to ensure there is no race condition."
msgstr ""
